WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Welcome to my 2H Restaurant Website project.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Built with HTML5 and CSS3, it presents a restaurant and its services.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.500
The home page welcomes visitors, and the menu bar links the pages.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:13.000
The menu and gallery pages show the food and images of the restaurant.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The reservation and contact pages give visitors the details they need.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Thank you for watching my 2H Restaurant Website demonstration.
